@lucamotz @ZJY0516, I picked up the handoff from #60168 and opened #60255.

This does not enable non-MLA DCP. It restores the existing rejection checks for NixlPullConnector and fixes the default interleave adjustment for supported MLA configurations. Explicit interleave validation remains unchanged.

The fix and regression coverage are ready for review: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/60255
